1) For all spells that affect Undead, GMs may want to give modifications to certain very powerful Undead. See Crea- tures & Monsters for a complete listing of Undead.
2) A caster can only attempt to repel a given Undead once per experience level (see Section 7.1.4).
3) See Section 7.1.30 for more on curses and removing them. CLERIC BASE LIST 2.4.5 REPULSIONS
